arm64: dts: qcom: sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin: add the camera graph

The board side of the port: the CAMSS node, the three module nodes with their
rails, clocks and pinctrl (rear S5KJN1 + GT9764 + EEPROM at 0x51, front
IMX596, depth SC202CS), the PM8350C flash LED, and the VCM address note
(0x0c, measured while the module is powered).

The rear module's autofocus rail (pm8350c l7) is marked always on and stays
at its 3.0 V default; no code writes a rail voltage.

